<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=Cp1252">
    <meta name="generator" content="Helen">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="../../../../javahelp.css">
    <title>Network creation</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="272" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Network creation
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="488">
      <col width="232">
      <col width="238">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="478">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Network creation</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="478">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">This use case, as its name
            suggests, is the one that the user initiates to create a new empty network.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="478">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user indicates to the program that he/she wants to create a new
            network.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" class=
          "western" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">2.The program asks for the information needed
            to create a new network.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the user does not want to create the network, he/she can cancel
            the operation, ending the use case.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The program checks that the information provided by the user is is
            correct.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.1.If some data is not correct, the program informs the user and goes
            to point 2.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.The program creates a new window associated to the network in the
            multi-document environment which title will be the name of the network.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" class=
          "western" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">5.All options of the menu related to multi-document environment are
            enabled (if they were not already).</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">6.A new item is created in the dependent menu of the multi-document
            environment that will be associated to the new window.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">7.The new window is selected and the use case <i>Selecting a
            network</i> is enabled.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
